ue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/6680","id":1320104951,"node_id":"IC_kwDODf6-U85OrzP3","user":{"login":"jakobhellermann","id":22177966,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTc3OTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22177966?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann","html_url":"https://github.com/jakobhellermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-18T14:50:39Z","updated_at":"2022-11-18T14:50:39Z","body":"I don't understand why this is broken. I thought we had the `rotate_right` in `generate_composite_uuid` to break the associativity of `XOR`:\r\nhttps://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/a02e44c0dbea5d343a27eef614c803a3daf2c2f5/crates/bevy_reflect/src/lib.rs#L79\r\n\r\nWhy does this not work?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1320104951/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jakobhellermann","id":22177966,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTc3OTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22177966?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann","html_url":"https://github.com/jakobhellermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakobhellermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1320340600","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/6680#issuecomment-1320340600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/6680","id":1320340600,"node_id":"IC_kwDODf6-U85Ossx4","user":{"login":"dis-da-mor","id":84386186,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0Mzg2MTg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84386186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor","html_url":"https://github.com/dis-da-mor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-18T17:49:16Z","updated_at":"2022-11-18T17:49:16Z","body":"That's a good point. When I saw that I wondered why that is, and now I think I get it. The problem is that in one case we have right associativity and in another we have left\r\n\r\nThe cases are 1.\r\n```rust\r\nC<A<B>> == C<B<A>>\r\n````\r\nwhich expands with right associativity like\r\n```rust\r\nA<B> = f(A, B)\r\nC<A<B>> = f(C, f(A, B))\r\n```\r\n\r\nand 2.\r\n```rust\r\nC<A, B> == C<B, A>\r\n```\r\nwhich expands with left associativity like\r\n```rust\r\nC<A, B> = f(f(C, A), B)\r\n```\r\nwith case `2` we expand like:\r\n ```rust\r\nC<A, B> = f(f(C, A), B)\r\n= C ^ r(A) ^ r(B)\r\n ```\r\ntherefore\r\n```rust\r\nC<B, A> = C ^ r(B) ^ r(A)\r\n```\r\nand so this fails as \r\n```rust\r\nC ^ r(A) ^ r(B) == C ^ r(B) ^ r(A) \r\n```\r\n\r\nWhat's the solution? Well we can\r\n- Do what I did in #6633 and `wrapping_add` the index of the parameter to the uuid or\r\n- change the expansion of case 2 to right associativity\r\nI did the first solution as it seems simpler.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1320340600/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"dis-da-mor","id":84386186,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0Mzg2MTg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84386186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor","html_url":"https://github.com/dis-da-mor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dis-da-mor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi